OL,4,BAlcaraz puts aside injury concerns to  
OL,5,Btake apart Cobolli                     
OL,6,GA ruthless Carlos Alcaraz put aside    
OL,7,Ghis injury concerns to dismantle       
OL,8,GFlavio Cobolli and ensure a perfect    
OL,9,Grecord in the ATP Finals group stages. 
OL,11,FSpain's Alcaraz hurt his left          
OL,12,Fhamstring in his previous match        
OL,13,Fagainst Daniil Medvedev and had a scan 
OL,14,Fon the injury on Thursday.             
OL,16,FHe arrived for his match against       
OL,17,FCobolli with strapping on his upper-   
OL,18,Fleft leg - as well as tape on his      
OL,19,Fright knee and a sleeve on his right   
OL,20,Farm - but was brutally efficient in a  
OL,21,F6-4 6-1 win.                           
